{"seq":1,"slug":"why-metric-learning","title":"为何度量学习：当\"分几类\"变成\"有多像\"","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/metric-learning-embeddings/foundations/why-metric-learning","wordCount":1575,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"为何度量学习-当-分几类-变成-有多像\">为何度量学习：当&quot;分几类&quot;变成&quot;有多像&quot;</h1><p>一个训练好识别 1000 类的图像网络，遇到第 1001 类会怎样？它会自信地把新类别硬塞进已有的某一格。这不是 bug，而是分类范式的本质：softmax 输出层的每一维绑定一个<strong>预先固定</strong>的类别，类别集合一旦改变，输出层就得推倒重来。可现实世界的类别几乎从不固定——人脸识别系统每天新增用户，电商每天上架商品，说话人验证要面对从未注册过的嗓音。度量学习换了一个提法：不预测类别，而是学一个把样本映射为向量的函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，让&quot;同类靠近、异类远离&quot;成为空间的普遍规律。新类别来了，只需算它的向量、和库里比距离，无需重训。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-从判别类别到判别相似\">核心概念：从判别类别到判别相似</h2><p>设样本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 经网络得到嵌入 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">R</mi><mi>d</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z = f_\\theta(x) \\in \\mathbb{R}^d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbb\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。度量学习的目标是学 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（有时再配一个距离 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span>），使得对任意同类对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(x_i, x_j)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 和异类对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(x_i, x_k)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≪</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D(z_i, z_j) \\ll D(z_i, z_k)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≪</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。分类学的是&quot;决策边界&quot;，度量学的是&quot;距离结构&quot;——后者更基础，因为有了距离结构就能派生出分类、检索、聚类等多种下游任务。</p>\n<p>下表对比两种范式在几个关键维度上的差异：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>分类（softmax）</th>\n<th>度量学习</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>学习目标</td>\n<td>类别后验 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(y\\mid x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>嵌入间的距离结构</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类别集合</td>\n<td>训练时固定，闭集</td>\n<td>开集，可新增而不重训</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>新类别成本</td>\n<td>重训输出层甚至全网</td>\n<td>仅需入库一条向量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>每类样本需求</td>\n<td>通常较多</td>\n<td>可极少（少样本/单样本）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型输出</td>\n<td>概率分布</td>\n<td>向量 + 相似度排序</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>天然下游</td>\n<td>打标签</td>\n<td>检索、验证、聚类、去重</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[输入样本 x] --&gt; B[嵌入网络 f_theta]&#10;    B --&gt; C[向量 z 属于 R^d]&#10;    C --&gt; D{下游任务}&#10;    D --&gt; E[检索: 按距离排序取 Top-K]&#10;    D --&gt; F[验证: 距离 vs 阈值 判同异]&#10;    D --&gt; G[聚类: 在嵌入空间跑 KMeans]&#10;    D --&gt; H[少样本: 与支持集原型比距离]&#10;    E --&gt; I[开集: 新类别只需入库&lt;br/&gt;无需重训输出层]&#10;    F --&gt; I&#10;    G --&gt; I&#10;    H --&gt; I\">flowchart TD\n    A[输入样本 x] --&gt; B[嵌入网络 f_theta]\n    B --&gt; C[向量 z 属于 R^d]\n    C --&gt; D{下游任务}\n    D --&gt; E[检索: 按距离排序取 Top-K]\n    D --&gt; F[验证: 距离 vs 阈值 判同异]\n    D --&gt; G[聚类: 在嵌入空间跑 KMeans]\n    D --&gt; H[少样本: 与支持集原型比距离]\n    E --&gt; I[开集: 新类别只需入库&lt;br/&gt;无需重训输出层]\n    F --&gt; I\n    G --&gt; I\n    H --&gt; I</pre><h2 id=\"开集问题-为什么闭集分类救不了你\">开集问题：为什么闭集分类救不了你</h2><p>闭集（closed-set）假设测试类别是训练类别的子集；开集（open-set）则允许测试期出现从未见过的类别。人脸验证是典型开集：系统上线后注册的用户，训练时根本不存在。若用分类思路，每来一个新用户就要加一个 softmax 神经元并微调，运维上不可接受。度量学习把&quot;是不是同一个人&quot;化为&quot;两个嵌入的距离是否小于阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span>&quot;——判据 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D(z_a, z_b) &lt; \\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 与具体身份无关，因而对新身份天然泛化。这正是 FaceNet 用三元组损失学 128 维嵌入、把 LFW 验证问题一举拿下的核心思想。</p>\n<p>值得强调的是，开集下评估的不是&quot;分类准确率&quot;，而是验证的真正例率/假正例率、或检索的 Recall@K，这套评估口径见 <a href=\"../practice/evaluation-metrics\">评估 (Recall@K)</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"少样本与长尾-把知识搬进空间\">少样本与长尾：把知识搬进空间</h2><p>当每个类别只有一两个样本（few-shot / one-shot），拟合一个每类都要足够样本的分类器几乎不可能。度量学习提供了优雅出路：把&quot;分类&quot;重写成&quot;离哪个类的原型（prototype，该类支持样本嵌入的均值）最近&quot;。原型网络（Prototypical Networks）就是这么做的——它不学类别权重，只学一个好的嵌入空间，分类退化为最近邻。长尾分布下同理：头部类别样本多、尾部类别样本少，但只要嵌入空间的相似性结构学得好，尾部类别也能靠少量样本被正确检索。</p>\n<p>这种&quot;把可迁移的知识编码进空间、把决策留给最近邻&quot;的思想，与半监督里利用未标注数据塑造表示的动机相通，可对照 <a href=\"../semi-supervised-learning/foundations/why-semi-supervised\">半监督学习</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一次学习-处处复用-嵌入即通用接口\">一次学习，处处复用：嵌入即通用接口</h2><p>度量学习最大的工程红利，是<strong>一个嵌入空间服务多个任务</strong>。同一套人脸嵌入，可以做 1:1 验证（刷脸支付）、1:N 检索（相册聚人）、也可以做聚类去重（同一人的照片归堆）。文本嵌入亦然：一套句向量既能做语义检索、又能做去重、还能喂给聚类做主题发现。这种&quot;嵌入作为通用接口&quot;的范式，是现代检索增强、推荐召回、向量数据库的共同地基——推荐系统的召回层本质上就是在一个学好的嵌入空间里做近邻检索，详见 <a href=\"../recommender-systems/deep-learning/embedding-recall\">推荐系统的嵌入召回</a>。</p>\n<p>代价是：你必须对空间的几何性质负责。分类器只要边界对就行，嵌入空间却要求整体的距离结构处处可信——这也是为什么本 hub 要专门用一章讲 <a href=\"../geometry/embedding-geometry\">嵌入空间几何</a>。</p>\n<p>红利也不是免费的：一旦上了度量学习，嵌入训练、索引维护、度量一致性、漂移监控就都成了你的责任。所以先判断任务是否真的需要它：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>任务特征</th>\n<th>推荐方案</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>类别固定且已知（闭集）</td>\n<td>普通分类器</td>\n<td>决策边界够用，无需完整距离结构</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>仅需一次性可视化</td>\n<td>UMAP / t-SNE</td>\n<td>无在线检索需求，降维直接满足</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类别会新增（开集）</td>\n<td>度量学习</td>\n<td>新类只需入库一条向量，无需重训</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>需相似度排序 / 检索 / 验证</td>\n<td>度量学习</td>\n<td>距离结构正是这些任务的直接接口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>少样本、每类样本极少</td>\n<td>度量学习 + 原型</td>\n<td>分类器欠拟合，最近邻反而更稳</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一套嵌入复用于多任务</td>\n<td>度量学习</td>\n<td>检索 / 验证 / 聚类共享同一空间</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>分类学&quot;这是第几类&quot;，度量学习学&quot;它们有多像&quot;；前者闭集、后者开集。</li>\n<li>开集、少样本、长尾、去重、验证——这些任务的共同解法是学一个好嵌入空间，把决策交给距离与最近邻。</li>\n<li>一套嵌入可同时服务检索、验证、聚类，是向量检索与推荐召回的通用接口。</li>\n<li>红利的代价是对空间几何负责，这将贯穿本 hub 后续三章。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h3><ul>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"distance-similarity\">距离与相似性</a> — 学度量前先搞清距离本身</li>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"metric-learning-taxonomy\">谱系</a> — 各类方法的地图</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../recommender-systems/deep-learning/embedding-recall\">推荐系统 · 嵌入召回</a> — 嵌入作为召回接口的落地</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"为何度量学习：当\"分几类\"变成\"有多像\"","id":"为何度量学习-当-分几类-变成-有多像"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：从判别类别到判别相似","id":"核心概念-从判别类别到判别相似"},{"level":2,"text":"开集问题：为什么闭集分类救不了你","id":"开集问题-为什么闭集分类救不了你"},{"level":2,"text":"少样本与长尾：把知识搬进空间","id":"少样本与长尾-把知识搬进空间"},{"level":2,"text":"一次学习，处处复用：嵌入即通用接口","id":"一次学习-处处复用-嵌入即通用接口"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":3,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"距离与相似性：尺子的数学底座","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/metric-learning-embeddings/foundations/distance-similarity"}}